# Generic hardcoded-secret assignment: a secret-ish key assigned a long literal.
# Promoted from the learn loop (LEARNED-1789845675-10, 2026-09-19 run): the
# textbook generalising secret shape — keyword-anchored, both separators, length-
# bounded to dodge ordinary short constants. Target narrowed to code/config
# extensions (no .md/.txt) on promotion.
id: KEUR-SECRET-001
maturity: 1
title: Hardcoded secret or token assigned to a variable
category: secret
severity: critical
engine: pattern
action: block
target:
  extensions: .js .php .rb .py .env .yml .yaml .json .ts .go .java
patterns:
  - regex: (?i)(api[_-]?key|token|secret|password)\s*[:=]\s*["'][^"']{12,}["']
    message: A secret key or token appears to be hardcoded. Load it from a secret store or environment variable instead of embedding the literal.
confidence: 0.9
fix: Read the secret from the environment or a secret manager; never commit the literal.
